-- title:
--   Exact residual coefficient polynomial C3
-- statement:
--   The bundle specifies an explicit vector of 32 rational real coefficients $c_i$, indexed by $0\le i<32$, and the complex polynomial
--
--   $$C_{3}(t)=\sum_{i=0}^{31}c_i t^i\qquad(t\in\mathbb C).$$
--
--   The complete coefficient table is part of the formal definition. This is residual coefficient data for the validated ninth-row inverse; its degree is at most 31.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/Amal-David/derivative-chain-prize/blob/21d2a2ac5cd4b4e6263cbc715dd5f925427fc976/continuation_formal/Source/Sixth9C3Data.lean#L39-L39; https://github.com/Amal-David/derivative-chain-prize/blob/21d2a2ac5cd4b4e6263cbc715dd5f925427fc976/continuation_formal/Source/Sixth9C3Data.lean#L7-L38

